ociations remain outcome-specific: weaker outcome_008 overall and stronger outcome_001 overall/within feature_027=0, but the new direct subgroup estimates do not localize those effects decisively. I close the due inconclusive claims to avoid spending the remaining budget on highly underpowered slices, while registering two direct refinements: outcome_001 feature_042 within feature_048=level_001 to test whether the accepted outcome_001 signal is concentrated in the minority feature_048 stratum suggested by H249, and outcome_011 feature_048 level_001 vs level_003 within feature_027=1 to test whether the unresolved feature_048/outcome_011 signal depends on the proxy-like feature_027 axis.",
